[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitlightrangefloor"]

; An omni and a spot light at range 0 on the left, and at range 0.3 on the right. Godot floors the
; range at 0.001 (`light_storage.cpp:895`), so the left pair lights nothing and the right pair lights
; a small pool each. three reads a distance of 0 as no cutoff, so a missing floor lights the whole
; ground. No other golden sets a range under 1. The dark sun keeps the editor's preview sun out.

